| moderation_actions | Subject and moderator history |
| locations | Geospatial search |
| user_location_preferences | User lookup |
| admin_audit_logs | Actor and time lookup |
| analytics_events | Event name and time analysis |
| user_roles | User active-role lookup (user_id, revoked_at) |

Use:

- B-tree indexes for common equality and ordered retrieval.
- Partial indexes for frequently queried filtered subsets.
- GIST indexes for appropriate PostGIS geometry/geography columns.
- Composite indexes that match actual query ordering.

Do not add redundant indexes.

Index additions must be evaluated against write overhead and storage costs.

