# 8. ROW LEVEL SECURITY (RLS) ARCHITECTURE

## 8.1 General requirements

RLS must be enabled on every exposed application table.

Policies must follow least privilege.

The database must not assume that a request is authorised merely because the user is authenticated.

## 8.2 Role model

The application supports:

- Guest.
- Registered user.
- Moderator.
- Administrator.
- Super administrator.

These are application permissions, not permission to trust client-provided role values.

Role resolution must come from a trusted server-controlled source: the `user_roles`
table only (D-18). `profiles` has no role column. No user may assign a role to
themselves through any user-facing API.

Guest Session Rule (D-03, decided 2026-11-20): a guest is an unauthenticated visitor,
identified by a server-issued guest-session token stored in the browser. A guest is
NOT an account. A guest MAY browse public discovery, view polls/results and game
descriptions, vote in polls, and play the 3 games. A guest may NOT post, comment,
react, join communities, report content, or create any game record associated with an
account (guest game sessions are tied to the guest session only, never to an account).
LIMITED TIME: a guest participation window lasts 60 minutes from the guest session's
first vote or game start, and ends on browser close, whichever is first. After expiry
the guest must register / log in to vote or play again. One vote per poll per guest
session; guest votes are counted. Guest game scores are not saved to a profile and do
not appear on leaderboards. After registration, guest-session votes/scores do NOT
transfer to the new account (no merge in the MVP). Rate limits apply per guest
session + IP (thresholds TBD in Product P1 config — do not invent). Guests may NOT
change or remove a vote (D-11).

## 8.3 Policy matrix

| Table | Guest | Registered user | Moderator | Administrator | Super Administrator |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| profiles | Public fields only | Own profile and public profiles | Approved moderation access | Approved administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| user_preferences | No | Own | No default access | Restricted support access | Restricted support access (audited) |
| user_consents | No | Own | No | Restricted compliance access | Restricted compliance access (audited) |
| user_blocks | No | Own | No default access | Restricted | Restricted (audited) |
| posts | Public published content | Public content and permitted writes | Moderation access | Administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| post_reactions | No private records | Approved reads and own writes | Approved moderation access | Administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| comments | Public permitted comments | Approved reads and own writes | Moderation access | Administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| polls | Public active polls; guest voting per Guest Session Rule (60-min window, one final vote) | Approved reads and voting | Moderation access | Administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| poll_options | Public poll options | Approved reads | Moderation access | Administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| poll_votes | Own guest-session vote only; no other private votes | Own vote details and approved aggregate results | Restricted | Restricted | Restricted — aggregates only, audited |
| games | Public active definitions; guest play per Guest Session Rule | Approved gameplay | No default access | Administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| game_questions | Public safe question content | Approved game access | No default access | Administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| game_options | Safe public options only | Approved gameplay | No default access | Administrative access | Full privileged access (audited) |
| game_sessions | Guest-session sessions only (not saved to a profile) | Own sessions | Restricted | Restricted | Restricted (audited) |
| game_answers | Guest-session answers only | Own sessions only | Restricted | Restricted | Restricted (audited) |
